                        ],
                        "form": "rocambolesques"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5e7c6f4-3e7e-32a0-af0a-492939dcef30",
                        "entry_id": "c0a6a12f-792f-3373-8ab8-aa7edf744060",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est plein de rebondissements, d’aventures remplies de péripéties invraisemblables, extraordinaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "335161ab-3bce-4cf7-a800-3caf7caee2f2",
                                "sense_id": "c5e7c6f4-3e7e-32a0-af0a-492939dcef30",
                                "text": "À partir de 1953, l'année de la mort de Staline, le lyssenkisme connut une éclipse partielle, due à une conjonction de plusieurs facteurs : le décès de son protecteur, le caractère rocambolesque de la métamorphose des espèces […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcd8e9e9-42e3-446e-99b7-b6462092b313",
                                "sense_id": "c5e7c6f4-3e7e-32a0-af0a-492939dcef30",
                                "text": "Né à Budapest en 1905, Koestler a eu une vie rocambolesque."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c83c606-3450-4612-ad46-829e4a096776",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0a6a12f-792f-3373-8ab8-aa7edf744060",
                        "source_sense_id": "c5e7c6f4-3e7e-32a0-af0a-492939dcef30",
                        "target_lang_word": "rocambolesque",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rocambolesque",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62442648-a714-3510-a910-b41fb5b6887b",
                                        "entry_id": "81dbe66d-fc69-385a-9511-aea996885bd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fantastic, incredible, fabulous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "880e8a3d-9b41-48c0-81e4-25bd19f503b2",
                                                "sense_id": "62442648-a714-3510-a910-b41fb5b6887b",
                                                "text": "a rocambolesque story"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d0cd095-91ef-4ddf-a5ad-537360be071c",
                                                "sense_id": "62442648-a714-3510-a910-b41fb5b6887b",
                                                "text": "Behind much of this were particular concrete New Left movements, some serious, some more rocambolesque."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8c66b62-cef4-4d0c-ae72-0b94e6d50377",
                                                "sense_id": "62442648-a714-3510-a910-b41fb5b6887b",
                                                "text": "Though not exactly seeking carpet slippers and the reassuring click of knitting needles he had envisaged a future rather less rocambolesque than the plot of the average Tarantino movie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea47b115-e257-4722-8d0e-930a8d5593e2",
                                                "sense_id": "62442648-a714-3510-a910-b41fb5b6887b",
                                                "text": "The latter in particular was an unlikely candidate for what would turn out to be the most rocambolesque experiences in the entire history of the encounter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
